---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../site';
---
<Prose title="About us" description={`Who writes ${SITE.name} and why: practical, checked guides for expats in Saudi Arabia.`} path="about/">
  <p>{SITE.name} explains Saudi procedures step by step for expats: iqama, visas, Absher, labor law, driving and daily life. Every guide links the official source it relies on and shows the date it was last checked. The most-used guides are also available in Urdu.</p>

  <h2>Who writes the guides</h2>
  <p>{SITE.name} is written by {SITE.owner}. <!-- TODO: two or three lines about yourself: how long you have lived in Saudi Arabia, your professional background, and why you started the site. Real first-hand experience is what readers and Google trust. --></p>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We start every guide from the official portal or ministry: Absher, Qiwa, MOFA, MHRSD, Jawazat and others.</li>
    <li>Each guide shows a "last checked" date. We recheck the most-read guides regularly and whenever a rule changes.</li>
    <li>We fix confirmed errors and note the correction on the page. See our <a href={url('editorial-policy/')}>editorial policy</a> and <a href={url('corrections/')}>corrections policy</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we are not</h2>
  <p>{SITE.name} is an independent website. It is not affiliated with the Saudi government, any ministry, or any embassy. Our guides explain procedures; they are not legal advice. Always confirm on the official portal before you act.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions, corrections or suggestions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</Prose>
